
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">


<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Marginalia Search</title>
    
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/fa-all.min.css" />
    

    
        <meta name="robots" content="index">

        <meta property="og:description" content="Marginalia Search is a small independent do-it-yourself search engine for surprising but content-rich websites that never ask you to accept cookies or subscribe to newsletters. The goal is to bring you the sort of grass fed, free range HTML your grandma used to write. " />
        <meta property="og:locale" content="en_US" />
        <meta property="og:site_name" content="Marginalia Search" />
        <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
        <meta property="og:url" content="https://marginalia-search.com/" />
    

    <link rel="search" type="application/opensearchdescription+xml" href="/opensearch.xml" title="Marginalia">

</head>
<noscript>
    <h1>Users of text-based browsers</h1>
    <p>Consider using the old interface at <a href="https://old-search.marginalia.nu/">https://old-search.marginalia.nu/</a>,
    as it uses fewer modern CSS tricks, and should work better than the new UI.  It's functionally nearly identical, but just renders it using a different layout.</p>
    <hr>
</noscript>

<body class="min-h-screen bg-bgblue dark:bg-gray-900 dark:text-white font-sans " >

<a class="sr-only" href="skipnav">Skip To Content</a>


<header class="bg-margeblue text-white">
    <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
        <nav>
            <div class="px-4">
                <div class="flex flex-row text-sm gap-1 xs:gap-2">
                    

                        <a href="/" class="has-[:checked]:underline py-2 px-2 hover:text-blue-200">
                            
                                <input type="checkbox" checked readonly class="hidden" tabindex="-1" />
                            
                            Search
                        </a>

                    

                        <a href="/site" class="has-[:checked]:underline py-2 px-2 hover:text-blue-200">
                            
                            Sites
                        </a>

                    

                        <a href="/explore" class="has-[:checked]:underline py-2 px-2 hover:text-blue-200">
                            
                            Explore
                        </a>

                    
                    <div class="grow"></div>
                    
                        <a href="https://about.marginalia-search.com/" class="has-[:checked]:underline  py-2 px-2 hover:text-blue-200">
                            
                            About
                        </a>
                    
                </div>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </div>
</header>


<header class="border-b border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 shadow-md">
    <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-4 py-2 sm:py-4">
        <div class="flex items-center">
            <div class="hidden sm:block md:w-32 md:mr-16 md:ml-16"><h1 class="text-md sm:text-xl mr-8 font-serif whitespace-nowrap"><a href="/">Marginalia Search</a></h1></div>
            <div class="w-full p-2 border-none backdrop-blur-sm">
                

<form id="search-form" class="flex-1 max-w-2xl" action="/search" method="get">

    <div class="flex">
        
        
            <input type="text"
                   class="shadow-inner flex-1 dark:bg-black dark:text-gray-100 bg-gray-50 border dark:border-gray-600 border-gray-300 text-gray-900 text-sm rounded-sm block w-full p-2.5"
                   value=""
                   autofocus
                   placeholder="Search the web!"
                   autocomplete="off"
                   name="query"
                   id="searchInput" />
        

        <div aria-hidden="true" id="searchSuggestions" class="text-sm absolute top-3 mt-10 w-96 bg-white dark:bg-black border dark:border-gray-600 border-gray-300 rounded-lg shadow-lg hidden"></div>

        <button class="px-4 py-2 bg-margeblue text-white ml-2 rounded whitespace-nowrap active:text-slate-200">
            <i class="fas fa-search text-sm sm:mr-3"></i>
            Search
        </button>

    </div>

    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    <input type="hidden" name="profile" value="corpo">

</form>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</header>

<div id="skipnav"></div>


<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col space-y-4 fill-w">
    <div class="border border-gray-300 border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-600 dark:bg-gray-800 bg-white rounded p-2 m-4 ">
        <div class="text-slate-700 dark:text-white text-sm p-4">
        The old version of Marginalia Search remains available
        <a href="https://old-search.marginalia.nu/" class="underline text-liteblue dark:text-blue-200">here</a>.
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto px-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row my-4 sm:space-x-2 space-y-2 sm:space-y-0 w-full md:w-auto items-center sm:items-stretch">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded overflow-hidden dark:bg-gray-800 bg-white p-8 sm:p-4 space-y-3 w-[300px] sm:w-64">
        <div><i class="fas fa-sailboat mx-2 text-margeblue dark:text-slate-200"></i>Explore the Web</div>
        <ul class="list-disc ml-8 sm:ml-6  text-slate-700 dark:text-white text-xs leading-5">
            <li>Prioritizes non-commercial content</li>
            <li>Tools for both search and discovery</li>
            <li>Find lost old websites</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col items-center border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded overflow-hidden dark:bg-gray-800 bg-white p-8 sm:p-4 space-y-3 w-[300px] sm:w-64">
        <div><i class="fas fa-hand-holding-hand mx-2 text-margeblue dark:text-slate-200"></i>Open Source</div>
        <ul class="list-disc ml-8 sm:ml-6  text-slate-700 dark:text-white text-xs leading-5">
           <li>Custom index and crawler software</li>
           <li>Simple technology, no AI</li>
           <li>AGPL license</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="flex pt-4 gap-2 flex-col md:flex-row">
        <div class="text-xs text-liteblue dark:text-blue-200">
            <i class="fa-brands fa-github"></i>
            <a href="https://git.marginalia.nu/" class="underline">Git Repository</a>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs text-liteblue dark:text-blue-200">
            <i class="fa-brands fa-discord"></i>
            <a href="https://chat.marginalia.nu/" class="underline">Project Discord</a>
        </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col items-center border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded overflow-hidden dark:bg-gray-800 bg-white p-8 sm:p-4 space-y-3 w-[300px] sm:w-64">
        <div><i class="fas fa-lock mx-2 text-margeblue dark:text-slate-200"></i> Privacy by default</div>
        <ul class="list-disc ml-8 sm:ml-6 text-slate-700 dark:text-white text-xs leading-5">
            <li>Filter out tracking </li>
            <li>No data shared with 3rd parties</li>
            <li>No long-term retention of IPs</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="text-xs text-liteblue dark:text-blue-200 pt-4">
            <i class="fas fa-link"></i>
            <a href="https://about.marginalia-search.com/article/privacy/" class="underline">Privacy Statement</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    </div>

</div>


<footer>
    <h1 class="sr-only">Policy Information</h1>
    <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto dark:bg-gray-800 bg-white p-5 text-sm border-gray-300 border dark:border-gray-600 rounded flex my-5 md:flex-row flex-col gap-2">
        <div class="flex space-y-4 flex-col">
            <h2 class="text-base"><i class="fas fa-briefcase mr-2 text-margeblue dark:text-slate-200"></i>Policies</h2>
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
            This website complies with the GDPR by not collecting any personal information,
            and with the EU Cookie Directive by not using cookies for any purpose other than
            to provide service functionality.
            </span>
            <span>
            Access logs containing IP-addresses are retained for up to 24 hours;
            anonymized logs with source addresses removed are sometimes kept longer
            to help diagnose bugs.
            </span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex space-y-4 flex-col">
            <h2 class="text-base"><i class="fas fa-envelope mr-2 text-margeblue dark:text-slate-200"></i>Contact</h2>
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
                You can reach the webmaster of the search engine at <a class="underline text-liteblue dark:text-blue-200" href="mailto:contact@marginalia-search.com">contact@marginalia-search.com</a>.
            </span>
            <div class="text-base"><i class="fas fa-gear mr-2 text-margeblue dark:text-slate-200"></i>Sources</div>
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
            The search engine is open source with an AGPL license. The sources can be perused at
                <a class="underline text-liteblue dark:text-blue-200" rel="external noopener nofollow" href="https://git.marginalia.nu/">https://git.marginalia.nu/</a>.
            </span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex space-y-4 flex-col">
            <h2 class="text-base"><i class="fas fa-database mr-2 text-margeblue dark:text-slate-200"></i>Data</h2>
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
            IP geolocation is sourced from the IP2Location LITE data available from
                <a rel="external noopener nofollow" class="underline  text-liteblue dark:text-blue-200" href="https://lite.ip2location.com/">https://lite.ip2location.com/</a>
            under
            <a rel="external noopener nofollow" class="underline text-liteblue dark:text-blue-200" href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/">CC-BY-SA&nbsp;4.0</a>.
            </span>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>

<script lang="javascript" src="js/typeahead.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
